  "created_at": "2026-10-20T13:34:54Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-10-20T13:34:54Z",
  "body": "Hi, \n\nI'd like to take this.\n\nOpenAIModel and AzureOpenAIModel already wrap chat.completions.create in ApiModel.retryer (3 attempts), while the OpenAI client still uses its default max_retries=2. \nOn a 429 those stack, so one rate limit becomes 9 requests.\n\nPlan: construct that client with max_retries=0 so only the outer retryer runs, and add a regression test against a local endpoint that always returns 429. \nNo change to how many times ApiModel.retryer itself retries.\n\nBest, \nShivansh ",
